openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.2.3) stable; urgency=low

  * Bays are now named by their stable SATA port (/dev/disk/by-path, PCI
    address of the controller plus port), not by the kernel ataN number,
    which changed after a reboot and left bays shown as empty. The old
    default is replaced on upgrade; ataN names still work.

 -- Rui <zrcz180@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:45:00 -0000

openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.2.2) stable; urgency=low

  * LCD: send the line length (16) in the write command. It was 0x20,
    so the panel waited for 32 characters and took the next line's
    command as text: the IP line and disk lines showed parts of other
    pages.

